# RK Hunter

rkhunter is an root virus scanner

## Installation
    
    sudo apt-get update rkhunter

    sudo rkhunter --update
    sudo rkhunter --propup

### Config File
    /etc/rkhunter.conf

### Log File
    /var/log/rkhunger.log

## Usage

### Update Database
    sudo rkhunter --propup

### Run a check
    sudo rkhunter --check

